WEBVTT

00:04:01.156 --> 00:04:03.036
On a cold day in February,

00:04:03.076 --> 00:04:07.556
where the ground was literally frozen
right beneath our feet,

00:04:07.596 --> 00:04:11.596
after spending so much time
meticulously removing the Jurassic clay

00:04:11.636 --> 00:04:14.316
from around the skeleton,

00:04:14.316 --> 00:04:15.516
we were blown away

00:04:15.556 --> 00:04:20.396
because we revealed what appeared to be
a gigantic skeleton

00:04:20.396 --> 00:04:23.796
unlike anything ever found
in Britain before.

00:04:24.116 --> 00:04:26.396
Clearly, this was a big deal.

00:04:28.236 --> 00:04:32.156
But we had to be very quick
to contain our excitement.